# Lumotus — Frontend

Stack: React 18, TypeScript, Vite, TailwindCSS v4, React Query v5, Zustand, Framer Motion, Axios.

## Cấu trúc

- `src/api/` — Axios client + hàm gọi API theo nhóm (`auth`, `decks`, `review`, ...)
- `src/pages/` — route-level; `src/components/ui/` — shared UI
- `src/types/` — interfaces khớp DTO backend
- `src/store/` — Zustand (auth, UI state nhẹ)

## API client

- Base URL `/api/v1`; interceptor gắn `Authorization: Bearer`
- Silent refresh: 401 → `POST /auth/refresh` (httpOnly cookie) → retry
- React Query: `staleTime` hợp lý; invalidate sau mutation (rate card, CRUD deck)

## Patterns

```typescript
// Poll async job (AI generate / import)
const pollJob = (jobId: string) =>
  queryClient.fetchQuery({
    queryKey: ['job', jobId],
    queryFn: () => api.jobs.get(jobId),
    refetchInterval: (data) =>
      data?.status === 'PENDING' || data?.status === 'PROCESSING' ? 2000 : false,
  });
```

- Review UI: Again / Hard / Good / Easy → `POST /review/{cardId}/rate`
- Card list: hỗ trợ pagination (`page`, `size`); loading skeleton
- Explore: filter `topicId`, search `q` (FTS backend)

## UI

- Tailwind utility-first; responsive mobile-first
- Framer Motion cho flip card review
- Hiển thị `phonetic`, `image_url`, `audio_url` khi có
- Error toast + form validation message từ API

## Types

- Rating: `'AGAIN' | 'HARD' | 'GOOD' | 'EASY'`
- Role: `'USER' | 'ADMIN'`
- Protected routes: check role cho `/admin/*`
